# Comments

Comments and XML docs are in Russian. Identifiers stay English.

XML `<summary>` is always multi-line: opening tag, body line(s), closing tag. Never one-line summary.

Document public types and members with `<summary>`. Add comments for implicit / non-obvious logic (why, edge case, order dependency). Do not narrate the obvious line-by-line. No filler `<param>`.

```csharp
/// <summary>
/// Null означает сгенерировать id из исходного файла.
/// </summary>
public string? PhotoId { get; }

// Сначала стадии: иначе Page.AddStage нарушит инвариант порядка
foreach (var stage in ordered)
    page.AddStage(stage);
```
